<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Third-Party Licenses — Fuzzwizard</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  h1 { border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: .3em; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  h3 { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  details { margin: .5rem 0; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  pre { background: #f6f6f6; padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 4px; font-size: .85em; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { pre { background: #1e1e1e; } }
  .license-group { margin-bottom: 2rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
  .license-tag { display: inline-block; background: #0969da; color: #fff; padding: .1em .5em; border-radius: 3px; font-size: .85em; margin-left: .5em; }
  .crate-list { margin: .5rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  .crate-list li { margin: .2rem 0; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .license-tag { background: #388bfd; } .license-group { border-bottom-color: #444; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-Party Licenses</h1>
<p>This page lists the third-party open-source components used by <strong>Fuzzwizard</strong>, together with their licence texts. It is generated automatically from <code>Cargo.lock</code> by <a href="https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about">cargo-about</a>.</p>

<h2>Summary</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>License</th><th>Count</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{#each overview}}
<tr><td>{{name}}</td><td>{{count}}</td></tr>
{{/each}}
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Licenses</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<div class="license-group">
<h3>{{name}} <span class="license-tag">{{id}}</span></h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="crate-list">
{{#each used_by}}
<li><strong>{{crate.name}}</strong> v{{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#if first_of_kind}}
<details>
<summary>License text</summary>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
</details>
{{/if}}
</div>
{{/each}}

<hr>
<p><small>Generated by <a href="https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about">cargo-about</a>.</small></p>
</body>
</html>
